  - m_Id: 7210971137
    m_Localized: Create New World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971138
    m_Localized: Name is optional; it determines the initial shape of this world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971139
    m_Localized: Identity & Save
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971140
    m_Localized: Leave blank to generate a prefixed name automatically
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971141
    m_Localized: Optional, e.g. Traveler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971142
    m_Localized: Save Name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971143
    m_Localized: Optional, e.g. North of the Campfire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971144
    m_Localized: Both names may be left blank; the system will fill in matching Player_
      and World_ names.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971145
    m_Localized: World Parameters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971146
    m_Localized: Planet Radius
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7210971147
    m_Localized: Larger values provide a wider exploration range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7219359744
    m_Localized: World Coordinate Scale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7219359745
    m_Localized: Smaller values are more spacious; larger values are denser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7219359746
    m_Localized: Finite Loop World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7219359747
    m_Localized: Cross a boundary to return from the opposite side; turn it off to
      use the original infinite world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7219359748
    m_Localized: "Leave blank for random \xB7 numbers or text are supported"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
