    m_Localized: Too hot and thirsty. Drink water and rest somewhere cool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11095680578740234
    m_Localized: Sweating has lowered my stamina capacity. I need some salty food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
