  - m_Id: 13269179082727424
    m_Localized: Freeze World Generation Rules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13269179137253376
    m_Localized: 'On: keep this save''s existing generation rules. Off: follow the
      current game version and upgrade the generation baseline; unexplored areas
      may change. Re-enable it to freeze the current rules the next time you enter
      the world.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13270765100064768
    m_Localized: 'On: keep this save''s existing generation rules. Off: follow the
      current game version and upgrade the generation baseline; base terrain and
      natural generation may change in both explored and unexplored areas, while
      player deltas are retained. Re-enable it to freeze the current rules the next
      time you enter the world.'
