    m_Localized: "help: command help\nstatus: current ship status\nclear: clear feedback\ndrive / exit: enter / leave the console\nignite: ignite / shut down engines\nnavigate X Y: navigate using view coordinates\npick: click the view to pick a navigation point\ncancel: cancel navigation\nland: begin landing on a nearby body\ndock / undock: confirm docking / disconnect a port\npressure kPa: set target supply pressure\nWASD applies thrust; release to keep drifting and reverse to brake. Q/E turns the ship; release to stop turning. Shutdown, power loss, or no fuel preserves translational momentum. Bodies do not pull in or stop ships; land safely with fuel, or fall and take impact damage without fuel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740097
    m_Localized: "Feedback cleared."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740098
    m_Localized: "At the controls. WASD accelerates, Q/E rotates, Esc leaves the console."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740099
    m_Localized: "Cannot drive: move near a valid powered console. Ships floating at sea cannot be driven."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740100
    m_Localized: "Left the controls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740101
    m_Localized: "You are not at the controls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740102
    m_Localized: "Ignition failed: power, valid aviation fuel, and sufficient lift thrust are required."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740103
    m_Localized: "Engines ignited."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740104
    m_Localized: "Engines shut down. The ship continues coasting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740105
    m_Localized: "Navigation target set. Progress will appear on the feedback screen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740106
    m_Localized: "Navigation failed: the ship must be in spaceflight, with a powered console and an autopilot block connected by optical fiber."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740107
    m_Localized: "Click the view to select navigation coordinates; right-click to cancel picking. Reopen the console for navigation feedback."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033120237740108
    m_Localized: "Cannot pick a point: a valid console in space is required."
